# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Asthana et al. (2024), MNRAS 533, 2843 (arXiv:2404.06548), Fig. 5 panel (e) (olive solid): mean free path at 912 A in proper Mpc (no h), z = 5-6.5.
#   "Extremely Early" reionization history: fiducial sources but ONE frequency bin, hydrogen only; midpoint
#   z = 9.09 from this curve, where Table 1 says 9.5 (Asthana et al. 2025 shows the same curve).
